[00:21.72]God’s Kingdom rules from above.
[00:27.54]All praise his Son, the beloved.
[00:33.40]Christ reigns in Zion, the chief cornerstone.
[00:45.02]Let us all lift up our voice.
[00:50.86]Sing to our God, and rejoice.
[00:56.28]Christ, Lord and Savior,
[01:00.74]has been placed upon His throne.
[01:07.79](Chorus)
[01:07.94]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:13.74]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[01:19.46]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:25.10]Eternal life and happiness.
[01:30.65]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[01:36.78]For his love and faithfulness.
[01:43.26]Christ now in power is here,
[02:02.67]And Armageddon is near.
[02:07.97]Satan’s old system will soon pass away.
[02:19.49]Now is the season to preach.
[02:25.35]Many there are yet to reach;
[02:31.17]Time for the meek
[02:34.57]to take their stand for Him today.
[02:42.45](Chorus)
[02:42.60]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[02:48.17]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[02:54.32]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[02:59.96]Eternal life and happiness.
[03:05.86]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[03:11.18]For his love and faithfulness.
[03:27.89]God’s reigning Ruler we prize.
[03:33.04]Wondrous he is in our eyes.
[03:38.59]He comes in God’s name; we bow to our King.
[03:49.79]Enter the grand temple gate;
[03:55.10]God’s favor now supplicate.
[04:00.81]Soon dawns that day
[04:04.32]when he rules over ev’rything.
[04:11.81](Chorus)
[04:11.96]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:17.83]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[04:23.62]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:29.20]Eternal life and happiness.
[04:35.75]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[04:38.08]For his love and faithfulness.
